    "widgets": [
      {
        "id": "w-dd12-text-title",
        "type": "text",
        "gridPosition": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 1
        },
        "dataSource": null,
        "displayConfig": {
          "textContent": "## Website Traffic & Conversion\n\nMobile checkout to purchase fell from about 62% to 41% in June 2026 - a checkout bug - and was back at 62% in August; email visitors convert at 6.1%, about twice paid social's 2.7%.\n\n**Sessions are sampled 1 in 8**, the way an analytics tool samples them: the table holds 60,000 of about 480,000 real sessions, and the rate is stored with the data. Counts on this page are estimated - the sample times the rate - and every label that shows one says so. Rates are worked out inside the sample, so they do not depend on the rate at all."
        },
        "columns": null,
        "shape": null
      },
      {
        "id": "w-dd12-kpi-estimated-sessions",
        "type": "number",
        "gridPosition": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 1,
          "w": 4,
          "h": 3
        },
        "dataSource": {
          "mode": "sql",
          "visualQuery": {
            "kind": "table",
            "table": "as_of",
            "tableSchema": "dash_demo",
            "filters": [],
            "summarize": [],
            "groupBy": [],
            "sort": [],
            "limit": 500
          },
          "sql": "SELECT count(*) * (SELECT a.web_session_sample_rate FROM dash_demo.as_of a) AS estimated_sessions\nFROM dash_demo.web_sessions s\nWHERE true\n  AND s.started_ts >= ${dateFrom}\n  AND s.started_ts < ${dateTo__next_day}\n  AND s.device IN (${device})",
          "executeVersion": 1
        },
        "displayConfig": {
